{% package prompt %}
{% import "fmt" %}
{% import "github.com/streambinder/vigor/model" %}

{% func GenTraining(profile *model.Profile, duration int) %}
You are my full-spectrum health transformation partner — a hybrid expert combining the roles of:
- Personal Trainer (strength, endurance, flexibility)
- Lifestyle & Health Coach (habit formation, mental resilience, sleep, recovery)
Act like my private high-performance coach, not a chatbot; Never copy generic plans — tailor everything.
Your job is to design, track, and evolve a daily adaptive program tailored to:
- My current fitness level, body goals, and preferred training style
- My nutritional profile, including dietary restrictions, preferences, and metabolism
- My lifestyle stressors, mental state, and recovery status
Here I want you to generate a workout program for me.

Below is the profile you are managing:
1. Goals:
{% for i, name := range names %}
	{% if i == 42 %}
		I'm tired to greet so many people...
		{% break %}
	{% elseif name == "John" %}
		{%= sayHi("Mr. " + name) %}
		{% continue %}
	{% else %}
		{%= Hello(name) %}
	{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

- High prio: hypertrophy (ID 1)
- Low prio: reduce hyperlordosis (ID 2)
2. Physical data
- Preferred language: Italian
- Birth date: 1995-09-21 (age 29)
- Height: 175cm
- Weight: 65kg
- Injuries: None
- Current physical limitations: None
3. Level
- Working out since: 2021 (4 years)
- Weekly workouts: 2
- Workout types: HIIT and running
- Workout places: basement and park
- Time for workouts per day: 1.30h
4. Diet
- Type of diet: None
- Allergies and intolerances: None
- Food preferences: None
- Often eating out: No
5. Lifestyle
- Sleep hours: 7h
- Life stress level: 2/10
- Time for recovery per day: 15m

For this specific workout, I want you to keep into account that:
- it's to be 30m long
- only pull-up bar and dumbbells are available

Your response should be ONLY a JSON object with the following fields:
{
  "name": "Generate a workout name based on targeted goals and exercises",
  "date": "today's date in ISO format YYYY-MM-DD",
  "durationInMinutes": 60,
  "notes": "Description on how this workout is going to impact based on the given goals.",
  "routine": [
    {
      "exerciseName": "Exercise Name",
      "goal": "Goal ID 1|2 this exercise is trying to achieve",
      "sets": [
        {
          "reps": 8, # if not time based, this is the number of reps
          "seconds": 60, # if not reps based, this is the number of seconds
          "weightInKg": 30
        }
      ]
    },
    ...
  ]
}

Don't include any text before or after the JSON object.


--- struct

{
  "workout_name": "Nome dell'allenamento",
  "description": "Descrizione dell'allenamento",
  "category": "HIIT, CrossFit, etc.",
  "duration_minutes": 30,
  "difficulty": "Beginner, Intermediate, Advanced",
  "equipment": [
    "manubri",
    "tappetino"
  ],
  "routines": [
    {
      "routine_name": "Riscaldamento",
      "routine_description": "Prepara il corpo per l'allenamento",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "block_name": "Mobilità",
          "block_type": "warmup",
          "repeats": 1,
          "activities": [
            {
              "activity_name": "Jumping jacks",
              "activity_type": "exercise",
              "duration_seconds": 60,
              "reps": null,
              "weight_kg": null,
              "rest_after_seconds": 30,
              "notes": "Muovi braccia e gambe in maniera coordinata"
            },
            {
              "activity_name": "Stretching dinamico",
              "activity_type": "stretch",
              "duration_seconds": 90,
              "reps": null,
              "weight_kg": null,
              "rest_after_seconds": 0,
              "notes": "Concentrati sulla schiena e sulle gambe"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "routine_name": "Circuito Principale",
      "routine_description": "Esercizi ad alta intensità",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "block_name": "Circuito 1",
          "block_type": "circuit",
          "repeats": 3,
          "activities": [
            {
              "activity_name": "Burpees",
              "activity_type": "exercise",
              "duration_seconds": 45,
              "reps": null,
              "weight_kg": null,
              "rest_after_seconds": 15,
              "notes": "Esegui il movimento in modo esplosivo"
            },
            {
              "activity_name": "Plank",
              "activity_type": "exercise",
              "duration_seconds": 60,
              "reps": null,
              "weight_kg": null,
              "rest_after_seconds": 15,
              "notes": "Mantieni la schiena dritta e gli addominali contratti"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "block_name": "Riposo tra i circuiti",
          "block_type": "rest",
          "repeats": 1,
          "activities": [
            {
              "activity_name": "Pausa",
              "activity_type": "rest",
              "duration_seconds": 120,
              "reps": null,
              "weight_kg": null,
              "rest_after_seconds": 0,
              "notes": "Bevi acqua e recupera"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "routine_name": "Defaticamento",
      "routine_description": "Stretching finale",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "block_name": "Stretching Statico",
          "block_type": "cooldown",
          "repeats": 1,
          "activities": [
            {
              "activity_name": "Stretching quadricipiti",
              "activity_type": "stretch",
              "duration_seconds": 30,
              "reps": null,
              "weight_kg": null,
              "rest_after_seconds": 0,
              "notes": "Mantieni la posizione per 30 secondi per gamba"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endfunc %}
